Anne Merker. Le désir. Études platoniciennes 4, 2007, pp. 205–235. French scholarly article.

[Journal reference](https://journals.openedition.org/etudesplatoniciennes/913).

This article is named in the published [Paris 1 undergraduate outline](Academic-benchmarks.lingua#r_7YDPSHERTRH41D7YR4P93PWNEP). Use it as an entry into the lexical and philosophical investigation of desire, then follow the actual research question and its competing interpretations.

